description_html:
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Account Manager, Hotels EMEA (German Speaking)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;France (Remote)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;With millions of diners, 60,000+ restaurant partners and 25+ years of experience, &lt;/strong&gt;OpenTable, part of Booking Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG), is an industry leader with a passion for helping restaurants thrive. Our world-class technology empowers restaurants to focus on what matters most – their team, their guests, and their bottom line – while enabling diners to discover and book the perfect restaurant for every occasion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every employee at OpenTable has a tangible impact on what we do and how we do it. You’ll also be part of a global team and its portfolio of metasearch brands. Hospitality is all about taking care of others, and it defines our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;OpenTable is seeking a dedicated and strategic Account Manager to manage, protect, and grow&amp;nbsp;our core hotel portfolio within the EMEA region. In this role, you will act as a trusted business&amp;nbsp;advisor, bridging clients&#39; operational needs with our innovative hospitality technology solutions.&amp;nbsp;You will collaborate cross-functionally with sales, product, and marketing teams to ensure client&amp;nbsp;success and drive a high return on investment. Additionally, you will leverage data-driven&amp;nbsp;insights to report on account health and influence our global product roadmap.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet and exceed assigned monthly and quarterly retention and revenue goals by protecting core revenue and closing growth opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure world-class customer satisfaction and support client operational needs by fully optimizing OpenTable&#39;s technology for every hotel account.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain operational excellence by documenting all client communications within&amp;nbsp;Salesforce and reporting on account health and KPIs to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate subject matter expertise on our full suite of solutions, including table management platforms and online marketing tools, to solve complex C-suite challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the &quot;Voice of the Customer&quot; by providing consistent field feedback on trends and feature requirements to Product and Marketing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist Hotels Account Executives and Inside Sales Representatives to ensure seamless client transitions from signed to live.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;German speaking to a business level proficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of Account Management or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working under pressure, meeting ambitious goals, and managing multiple priorities simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding negotiating and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An aptitude for data-driven business decisions and the ability to reframe a client&#39;s view of their business through insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel 30-50% across the EMEA region for on-site client meetings and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Account Management experience within a B2B SaaS or high-growth hospitality technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business-fluent German language skills to support regional customers with clarity and cultural awareness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Google Suite and CRM solutions like Salesforce, along with AI fluency and its professional application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior restaurant management or food and beverage (F&amp;amp;B) sales experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine passion for the hospitality industry and technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits, Pay and Perks:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;There are a variety of factors that go into determining a salary range, including but not limited to external market benchmark data, geographic location, and years of experience sought/required.&lt;br&gt;The salary range for role located in &lt;strong&gt;France&lt;/strong&gt; is&lt;strong&gt; €40,000-€50,000&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;In addition to a competitive base salary, roles are eligible to be considered for additional compensation and benefits in accordance with local law and company policy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Benefits:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from (almost) anywhere for up to 20 days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid leave, vacation &amp;amp; time off for your birthday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vacation: you accrue 25 days a year + RTTs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wedding days: 4 days off for your own wedding and 1 day for your child’s wedding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health and Life Insurance Scheme with Malakoff Humanis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occupational Health Service with the occupational health provider of your region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on your career growth:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development Dollars&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to thousands of on-demand e-learnings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OpenTable, we pride ourselves on fostering a global and dynamic work environment. As a team member with us, you will benefit from a schedule tailored to accommodate a global workforce operating across multiple time zones. While the majority of your responsibilities may align with conventional business hours, there will be instances where you are expected to manage communications - via calls, Slack messages, or emails - outside of regular working hours to effectively collaborate with international colleagues, respond to restaurant partners, and/or address urgent matters. OpenTable will always abide by and consider local laws and regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels they belong and can thrive. We know the best ideas come when we bring different voices to the table, so we&#39;re building a team as dynamic as the diners and restaurants we serve—and fostering a culture where everyone feels welcome to be themselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you need any reasonable adjustments during the application or interview process, or on the job, we’re here to support you. Please reach out to your recruiter to request any accommodations.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
